        "PublicId": "122276107378",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "Voting has come to Whittleton Creek and it&apos;s your mission to make sure the votes aren&apos;t rigged.\r\rCharles Blake III has been winning through gerrymandering, a pracrice that&apos;s frowned upon by opponents and voters alike. Him and his assistant, Aiden Kelly, have been conspiring behind the scenes to change voting areas so Whittleton Creek is now in his favour even though it shouldn&apos;t be.\r\rHelen West has been helping Blake through killing opponents with her baked goods.\r\rMake voting fair again agent",
